---
/*
 * Section 6 — start with one.
 *
 * This section was cut from the previous build and is restored by the approved copy.
 * It is the page's only pause: no cards, no illustration, no call to action, one short
 * band of centred prose between the demonstration and the close.
 *
 * That is the whole design brief. Four sections in a row have asked the reader to take
 * something in — six opportunities, four steps, four more steps, a working system. A
 * page that never lets up reads as a pitch. This is the beat where the argument stops
 * arguing and simply states the case for going small, and the visual quiet is what
 * makes the closing line land.
 *
 * It gets its own background tint so the pause is visible before it is read.
 */
---

<section class="section section--stage start">
  <div class="container start__inner">
    <span class="eyebrow">Start with one</span>

    <h2 class="start__title">
      A single implementation is the lowest-risk way to test this.
    </h2>

    <p class="start__body">
      We implement one process properly, measure what it returns, and apply what we
      learn to the next. It&rsquo;s also the least expensive way to establish whether AI
      works in your business at all.
    </p>

    <p class="start__close">
      A year from now, that&rsquo;s the difference between still evaluating AI and
      already operating with it.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .start__inner {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .start .eyebrow {
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .start__title {
    font-size: var(--ark-h2);
    line-height: var(--ark-lh-h2);
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    max-width: 22ch;
  }

  /* The one place a body paragraph is centred. It is two sentences with no list and
   * no clause to lose your place in, and the pause the section exists to create needs
   * the block to be symmetrical. Everywhere else on the page, prose stays left. */
  .start__body {
    margin-top: 28px;
    font-size: var(--ark-body-lg);
    line-height: var(--ark-lh-body);
    color: var(--ark-body-ink);
    max-width: 58ch;
  }

  .start__close {
    margin-top: 32px;
    font-family: var(--ark-font-display);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: var(--ark-h3);
    line-height: var(--ark-lh-h3);
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: var(--ark-ink);
    max-width: 42ch;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .start__body {
      margin-top: 20px;
      max-width: 36ch;
    }

    .start__close {
      margin-top: 24px;
      max-width: 28ch;
    }
  }
</style>
